# Project structure (Money Tracker)

**Laravel** app with **Inertia + React (JSX)** and **Vite**. OAuth API via **Laravel Passport**; permissions **Spatie**; debugging **Telescope** (and **Debugbar** in development).

## Directory tree (summary)

Excludes `vendor/`, `node_modules/`, `.git/` (dependencies and version control).

```
money-tracker/
├── .cursor/rules/          # Project Cursor rules (*.mdc)
├── app/
│   ├── Http/
│   │   ├── Controllers/
│   │   └── Middleware/HandleInertiaRequests.php
│   ├── Mail/             # Mailables (p. ej. verificación por correo)
│   ├── Models/
│   ├── Services/         # Casos de uso (p. ej. Auth/EmailVerificationCodeService)
│   └── Providers/        # AppServiceProvider, TelescopeServiceProvider
├── bootstrap/              # app.php, providers.php, cache/
├── config/                 # app, auth, database, passport, permission, sanctum, telescope, …
├── database/
│   ├── factories/
│   ├── migrations/         # users, cache, jobs; oauth (Passport); permission (Spatie); telescope
│   ├── seeders/
│   └── database.sqlite     # Local SQLite (environment-dependent)
├── docker/                 # entrypoint.sh
├── public/                 # index.php, build/ (compiled Vite assets)
├── resources/
│   ├── css/app.css
│   ├── js/
│   │   ├── app.jsx         # Inertia / Vite bootstrap
│   │   ├── components/     # atoms/, molecules/ (UI reutilizable)
│   │   └── pages/          # React pages (e.g. Welcome.jsx)
│   └── views/              # app.blade.php (Inertia shell), welcome.blade.php
├── routes/
│   ├── web.php
│   └── console.php
├── storage/                # logs, framework, oauth-*.key (do not commit secrets)
├── tests/                  # Feature/, Unit/, TestCase.php
├── artisan
├── composer.json / composer.lock
├── package.json / package-lock.json / vite.config.js
├── phpunit.xml
├── docker-compose.yml
├── Dockerfile
├── .env / .env.example
└── README.md
```

## Important files and folders

| Area | Where to look first |
|------|---------------------|
| HTTP entry | [routes/web.php](mdc:routes/web.php) |
| Inertia SPA | [resources/js/app.jsx](mdc:resources/js/app.jsx), [resources/views/app.blade.php](mdc:resources/views/app.blade.php), [app/Http/Middleware/HandleInertiaRequests.php](mdc:app/Http/Middleware/HandleInertiaRequests.php) |
| Front build | [vite.config.js](mdc:vite.config.js), output in `public/build/` |
| Models | [app/Models/](mdc:app/Models/) |
| API auth | [config/passport.php](mdc:config/passport.php), [config/auth.php](mdc:config/auth.php) |
| Roles/permissions | [config/permission.php](mdc:config/permission.php) |
| Observability | [config/telescope.php](mdc:config/telescope.php), [app/Providers/TelescopeServiceProvider.php](mdc:app/Providers/TelescopeServiceProvider.php) |
| Container | [docker-compose.yml](mdc:docker-compose.yml), [Dockerfile](mdc:Dockerfile), [docker/entrypoint.sh](mdc:docker/entrypoint.sh) |
| Agent rules | [.cursor/rules/](mdc:.cursor/rules/) |

## Notes

- Do not document or commit secrets; use only [`.env.example`](mdc:.env.example) as the variable reference.
- `storage/oauth-*.key` and `.env` are sensitive to the local environment.
